<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<%- include('head'); -%>

<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <%- include('header'); -%>
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>


    <section>

      <p class="italic">Last Updated: July 2026</p>

      <h2>Overview</h2>
      <p>At Ahey, we believe your privacy matters. This policy explains what information we collect, how we use it, and how we protect it. Since Ahey doesn't require accounts or logins, we collect very little personal data.</p>

      <h2>What Information We Collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>IP addresses:</strong> We collect your IP address temporarily to establish your peer-to-peer connection with other participants</li>
        <li><strong>Device information:</strong> Basic technical information about your device and browser (used for the connection only)</li>
        <li><strong>Call metadata:</strong> The room URL you visited and when you joined (not the content of your calls)</li>
      </ul>
      <p><strong>What we don't collect:</strong> We don't collect your name, email, phone number, or any personal identifying information unless you voluntarily share it during a call.</p>

      <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>We use the information we collect only to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Establish and maintain your peer-to-peer video connection</li>
        <li>Keep our service running smoothly and fix technical problems</li>
        <li>Monitor and improve service quality and performance</li>
        <li>Comply with legal requirements</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not sell, rent, or share your information with third parties for marketing purposes.</p>

      <h2>Call Content & Recording</h2>
      <div class="highlight">
        <strong>Your conversations are yours alone.</strong> Ahey does not record, store, or monitor the content of your calls. Your video and audio go directly between participants - they don't pass through our servers.
      </div>
      <p>If someone on your call records the conversation without permission, that's on them - not us. We have no way to access or prevent recordings made on users' devices.</p>

      <h2>How Long We Keep Information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Session data:</strong> Deleted automatically when your call ends</li>
        <li><strong>Connection logs:</strong> Kept for 30 days for technical troubleshooting, then deleted</li>
        <li><strong>Call content:</strong> Never stored (we have no access to it)</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Cookies & Tracking</h2>
      <p>Ahey does not use cookies or tracking pixels. We don't track your browsing history or follow you across websites.</p>

      <h2>Security</h2>
      <p>We take reasonable precautions to protect the information we collect. However, no online service is 100% secure. Since we collect minimal data and don't store call content, there's less for anyone to compromise.</p>

      <h2>Third-Party Websites</h2>
      <p>If Ahey is embedded on another website, that website's privacy policy applies to your data on their site. We're not responsible for third-party privacy practices. Always review the privacy policy of any website that embeds Ahey.</p>

      <h2>Your Rights & Choices</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>No account = no data about you:</strong> Since we don't require sign-ups, we don't have a profile to access or delete</li>
        <li><strong>Disable your camera/mic:</strong> You can turn off video and audio at any time during a call</li>
        <li><strong>Browser settings:</strong> You can clear your browser data at any time</li>
        <li><strong>Do Not Track:</strong> We respect browser Do Not Track requests</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>Ahey is not intended for users under 18. We don't knowingly collect information from anyone under 18. Parents or guardians who believe a child has used Ahey should contact us.</p>

      <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this privacy policy from time to time. If we make significant changes, we'll notify users. Your continued use of Ahey means you accept any changes to this policy.</p>

      <h2>Contact Us</h2>
      <p>If you have questions about this privacy policy or how we handle your information, please reach out to us.</p>


    </section>

    <hr />

    <p><em>Privacy first. Always.</em></p>
    <%- include('footer'); -%>
  </div>
</body>

</html>